r operations, not arbitrary gameplay acceptance; agent instruction files do not establish equal live testing.","limitations","What the source actually contains","Verified .NET CLI Program.cs, C# HTTP daemon/main-thread dispatcher, serialized-field and prefab/scene commands, and Unity Test Framework command implementations. Agent integration files explicitly cover Claude Code skills, Codex AGENTS.md, Cursor rules, and Gemini CLI GEMINI.md.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[78],"evidenceUrl",{"_49":74,"_24":79},"https://github.com/jkpp/agent2unity-cli/tree/main/agents","Code / instructions",[83],"codeUrl",{"_49":80,"_24":84},"https://github.com/jkpp/agent2unity-cli/tree/main/unity-plugin/Agent2Unity/Editor","Primary source",[88],"sourceUrl",{"_49":85,"_24":89},"https://github.com/jkpp/agent2unity-cli","Engine / runtime","Unity","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[99,100,101,102],"agents","Claude Code","Codex","Cursor","Gemini CLI","Toolkit category","Engine bridges","lead","summary","bridge",[110,111,112,113],"implementation","claude-code","codex","cursor","gemini-cli",{"_115":116},"documents",{"_117":118,"_119":120},"en",[122,126,127,128,125,129,130,131,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,124,161,123,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182],"zh",[121,122,123,124,125],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-bou